# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets — never commit a key. A key in a commit is a key on the internet;
# treat one that leaks as already spent and revoke it in AI Studio.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Instructor-only material — never ships, at any point in the course.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*-instructor.ipynb
*instructor*
course-design/
cohorts/
roster.csv
*.private.*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# solutions.ipynb is deliberately NOT listed above.
#
# Solutions ship one session late: session N's solutions are published together
# with session N+1, once that exercise has been reviewed in class. So the file
# is withheld by *timing*, not by git.
#
# Ignoring it would be an expensive mistake — at the session 2 release
# `git add session-01/solutions.ipynb` would silently do nothing, and the
# omission would only surface when a student asked where the solutions were.
#
# What actually enforces the timing: only the intended files are copied into
# this repo, and the full manifest is reviewed before every push.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment & build
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
node_modules/

# Local vector store (session 8 runs Qdrant on your machine)
.qdrant/
qdrant_storage/
# session 8's knowledge base on disk, rebuilt any time by kb/ingest.py
.state/

# Scratch — keep the repo clean; put throwaway experiments here
scratch/
test.py
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS noise
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
